WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.100
A comparison claimed, and never made.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.500
Four ways to have nobody, and four things to do.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.100
One sentence for all four would be worse than none.

4
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.100
So one function decides it, for both paths.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.600
And the note stops saying compares.

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.100
The diagnostic shows the reason too.

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.500
Then a formatter hid a defect from its own gate.

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.000
The fix was a leftover file, not a cleverer match.

9
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.900
A report about one company says why.
